{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Comprendre un service de Diplom\u00e8tre"},"description":"\u00c0 quoi sert le comparateur ? Que contient le rapport d\u2019orientation ou le Pass Parcoursup ? Combien co\u00fbte ce service ? Pr\u00e9sente le contenu et les limites d\u2019un service de Diplom\u00e8tre, seulement si vous posez vous-m\u00eame une question \u00e0 son sujet. Pour un service payant, le prix et la page d\u2019offre ne sont donn\u00e9s que si vous avez indiqu\u00e9 \u00eatre adulte. Aucun achat, aucune r\u00e9servation, aucune prise de contact ni acc\u00e8s \u00e0 un rapport ou \u00e0 un Pass personnel.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"public_demandeur":{"description":"\u00ab adulte \u00bb seulement si la personne a d\u00e9j\u00e0 dit \u00eatre majeure ou parler comme parent ou professionnel ; \u00ab mineur \u00bb si elle a dit avoir moins de 18 ans ou \u00eatre au coll\u00e8ge ou au lyc\u00e9e ; sinon \u00ab non_precise \u00bb. Ne jamais demander l\u2019\u00e2ge pour cet outil et ne pas d\u00e9duire l\u2019\u00e2ge du statut d\u2019\u00e9tudiant.","enum":["adulte","mineur","non_precise"],"type":"string"},"service":{"description":"Service explicitement demand\u00e9 par la personne","enum":["site_gratuit","rapport","pass","comparaison_rapport_pass","accompagnement","ecoles","professionnels","partenaires","api_et_donnees"],"type":"string"}},"required":["service"],"type":"object"},"name":"consulter_service","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"contenu":{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":6,"type":"array"},"intitule":{"type":"string"},"liens":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"titre":{"type":"string"},"url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"}},"required":["titre","url"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":4,"type":"array"},"limites":{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":10,"type":"array"},"offres":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"code":{"enum":["rapport","pass"],"type":"string"},"commande":{"enum":["ouverte","fermee","non_communique"],"type":"string"},"prix":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"devise":{"const":"EUR","type":"string"},"montant_ttc_centimes":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"statut":{"enum":["provisoire","valide"],"type":"string"},"taux_tva_pourcent":{"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"required":["montant_ttc_centimes","devise","taux_tva_pourcent","statut"],"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["code","commande","prix"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":2,"type":"array"},"publics":{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":4,"type":"array"},"resume":{"type":"string"},"service":{"enum":["site_gratuit","rapport","pass","comparaison_rapport_pass","accompagnement","ecoles","professionnels","partenaires","api_et_donnees"],"type":"string"}},"required":["service","intitule","resume","publics","contenu","limites","liens","offres"],"type":"object"},"title":"Comprendre un service de Diplom\u00e8tre"}
